List all tasks defined across all
authorized directories

Usage:
  cron-person task list [flags]

Flags:
  -h, --help   help for list

Global Flags:
      --config string
        Path to custom configuration
        file (default:
        $XDG_CONFIG_HOME/cron-person/config.json)
      --store string
        Path to custom authorization
        state file (default:
        $XDG_STATE_HOME/cron-person/allowed.json)
